    "name": "Cluck Frenzy",
    "steam_appid": 2675420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675420/extras/7b549834cc1d4296d4f5b206656dc2d6.avif?t=1709137543\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Cluck Frenzy combines Strategy and PVP gameplay to provide a wild party game experience set in a mad farmer\u2019s barn. Yes, really. With nothing but their small skillsets, agility and plenty of fur, our cute critters are ready for a clucking crazy heist. <br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675420/extras/d376d14337a3716f2bb12a9abdb3ac4f.avif?t=1709137543\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Use your knowledge of exploration and strategy to get one up on your friends and collect the most chickens without getting caught by the farmer or his traps!<br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675420/extras/e17465c52093e266a9b417ca649a5754.avif?t=1709137543\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Discover every nook and cranny of the crazily intricate barn built by Haymitch the mad farmer. Run, jump and hide as you potentially find secrets to piece together more about the characters in Cluck Frenzy.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675420/extras/7b549834cc1d4296d4f5b206656dc2d6.avif?t=1709137543\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Cluck Frenzy combines Strategy and PVP gameplay to provide a wild party game experience set in a mad farmer\u2019s barn. Yes, really. With nothing but their small skillsets, agility and plenty of fur, our cute critters are ready for a clucking crazy heist. <br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675420/extras/d376d14337a3716f2bb12a9abdb3ac4f.avif?t=1709137543\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Use your knowledge of exploration and strategy to get one up on your friends and collect the most chickens without getting caught by the farmer or his traps!<br><br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2675420/extras/e17465c52093e266a9b417ca649a5754.avif?t=1709137543\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Discover every nook and cranny of the crazily intricate barn built by Haymitch the mad farmer. Run, jump and hide as you potentially find secrets to piece together more about the characters in Cluck Frenzy.",
    "short_description": "Cluck Frenzy is a 2-player PvP game that combines strategy and chaos to make a wild party game. Grab a friend and compete to get the most chickens for yourself, but watch out! The farmer won't let his chickens go easy. Will you be the winner?",
